[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":180},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26},"tipo","metodo","cubo",{"_11":178,"_13":178,"_29":179},"id","basico","nome","Beginner method","nomeLongo","Beginner method (layers)","termo",{"_29":175,"_176":177},"niveis",[58],"introducao","<p>The way to solve the cube for the first time: layer by layer, from the bottom up, with yellow always on top. After an introduction page, there are 8 steps, and each one uses at most one or two short algorithms. Open each step with the cube in your hand and follow along with the diagrams. Take your time: here you learn how the pieces move, and that counts for everything else.</p>\n","etapas",[33,34,35,36,37,38,39,40,41],"historias",[27],{"_13":28,"_29":30,"_31":32},"The Rubik's Cube and the beginner method (layers)","endereco","/historia#basico","resumo","The cube was created in 1974 by Hungarian Ernő Rubik and reached the whole world in 1980.",{"_11":169,"_13":170,"_44":171,"_46":172,"_48":173,"_50":-7},{"_11":163,"_13":164,"_44":165,"_46":166,"_48":167,"_50":-7},{"_11":150,"_13":151,"_44":152,"_46":153,"_48":154,"_50":155},{"_11":136,"_13":137,"_44":138,"_46":139,"_48":140,"_50":141},{"_11":123,"_13":124,"_44":125,"_46":126,"_48":127,"_50":128},{"_11":111,"_13":112,"_44":113,"_46":114,"_48":115,"_50":116},{"_11":99,"_13":100,"_44":101,"_46":102,"_48":103,"_50":104},{"_11":87,"_13":88,"_44":89,"_46":90,"_48":91,"_50":92},{"_11":42,"_13":43,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51},"arestas","Edges in place","html","<p>The top edges in the right place. The end: the cube solved.</p>\n","grupos",[53,54],"pagina",{"_13":43,"_29":52},"treino","/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/arestas/casos,basico/ultima-camada/casos","/3x3/basico/arestas",{"_11":82,"_13":43,"_57":58,"_59":83,"_61":84,"_63":85,"_29":86},{"_11":55,"_13":56,"_57":58,"_59":60,"_61":62,"_63":64,"_29":65},"Passos 4 a 7","Last layer (steps 4 to 7)","nivel","iniciante","casos",16,"conjunto",true,"ids",[66,67,68,69,70,71,72,73,74,75,76,77,78,79,80,81],"/3x3/basico/ultima-camada/casos","B4-Linha","B4-L","B4-Ponto","B5-Peixe-Sune","B5-Peixe-Anti-Sune","B5-Cruz-H","B5-Pi","B5-Farois","B5-T","B5-Gravata","B6-Dois-cantos-certos","B6-Nenhum-par-certo","B7-Uma-certa-A","B7-Uma-certa-B","B7-Nenhuma-certa-H","B7-Nenhuma-certa-Z","Passo 7",4,false,[78,79,80,81],"/3x3/basico/arestas/casos","cantos","Corners in place","<p>The top corners in the right place, looking for the headlights.</p>\n",[94],{"_13":88,"_29":93},"/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/cantos/casos","/3x3/basico/cantos",{"_11":95,"_13":88,"_57":58,"_59":96,"_61":84,"_63":97,"_29":98},"Passo 6",2,[76,77],"/3x3/basico/cantos/casos","face-amarela","Yellow face","<p>The top corners with yellow facing up, with the <a href=\"/en/glossary#sune\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"Two short OLL algorithms that orient 3 corners: R U R' U R U2 R' (Sune) and R U2 R' U' R U' R' (Anti-Sune).\">Sune</a>.</p>\n",[106],{"_13":100,"_29":105},"/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/face-amarela/casos","/3x3/basico/face-amarela",{"_11":107,"_13":100,"_57":58,"_59":108,"_61":84,"_63":109,"_29":110},"Passo 5",7,[69,70,71,72,73,74,75],"/3x3/basico/face-amarela/casos","cruz-amarela","Yellow cross","<p>The top edges with yellow facing up, with <code>F R U R&#39; U&#39; F&#39;</code>.</p>\n",[118],{"_13":112,"_29":117},"/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/cruz-amarela/casos","/3x3/basico/cruz-amarela",{"_11":119,"_13":112,"_57":58,"_59":120,"_61":84,"_63":121,"_29":122},"Passo 4",3,[66,67,68],"/3x3/basico/cruz-amarela/casos","segunda-camada","2nd layer","<p>The middle edges, with one algorithm for the right and its mirror for the left.</p>\n",[130],{"_13":124,"_29":129},"/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/segunda-camada/casos","/3x3/basico/segunda-camada",{"_11":131,"_13":124,"_57":58,"_59":96,"_61":84,"_63":132,"_29":133},"Passo 3",[134,135],"/3x3/basico/segunda-camada/casos","B3-Aresta-p-direita","B3-Aresta-p-esquerda","primeira-camada","1st layer","<p>The white corners, with the <a href=\"/en/glossary#sexy-move\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The trigger R U R' U', the most common of all.\">sexy move</a> (<code>R U R&#39; U&#39;</code>).</p>\n",[143],{"_13":137,"_29":142},"/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/primeira-camada/casos","/3x3/basico/primeira-camada",{"_11":144,"_13":137,"_57":58,"_59":120,"_61":84,"_63":145,"_29":146},"Passo 2",[147,148,149],"/3x3/basico/primeira-camada/casos","B2-Branco-a-direita","B2-Branco-na-frente","B2-Branco-em-cima","cruz","White cross","<p>Each petal of the daisy goes down to its place.</p>\n",[157],{"_13":151,"_29":156},"/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/cruz/casos","/3x3/basico/cruz",{"_11":158,"_13":151,"_57":58,"_59":96,"_61":84,"_63":159,"_29":160},"Passo 1",[161,162],"/3x3/basico/cruz/casos","B1-Branco-em-cima","B1-Branco-na-frente","flor","The daisy","<p>The 4 white edges around the yellow center, with no algorithm.</p>\n",[],{"_13":164,"_29":168},"/3x3/basico/flor","antes","Before you start","<p>The pieces, how to hold the cube and how to read an algorithm.</p>\n",[],{"_13":170,"_29":174},"/3x3/basico/antes","/en/glossary#basico","dica","Most people's first method: it solves the cube layer by layer, in 8 steps, with few algorithms. It's slow, but it teaches how the pieces…","3x3","/3x3/",{"_181":182,"_183":184},"cubos",[187,188,189,190,191,192],"idiomas",[185,186],"pt","en",{"_11":178,"_13":178},{"_11":199,"_13":199},{"_11":198,"_13":198},{"_11":197,"_13":197},{"_11":195,"_13":196},{"_11":193,"_13":194},"pyraminx","Pyraminx","megaminx","Megaminx","5x5","4x4","2x2"]
